              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LucyLoo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My first time making pizzelles! I just gone done making this recipe and they turned out great! I omitted the anise extract &amp; seeds, added more vanilla extract &amp; 2 tsp of cinnamon. Thin &amp; crisp, just like my Mom made!",
